{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10921","headline":"前苦寒行二首 二 · 杜甫","name":"前苦寒行二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年白帝雪在山，今年白帝雪在地。\n冻埋蛟龙南浦缩，寒刮肌肤北风利。\n楚人四时皆麻衣，楚天万里无晶辉。\n三足之乌足恐断，羲和送将何所归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}